  "description": "CalDAV for Elarion (ADR-0111): calendar sources (ordinary query handlers that decide who sees which calendar), ICalDavPublisher publishing Elarion.Calendars objects into the published-collection store in the handler's transaction, the calendar properties and reports (calendar-multiget, calendar-query with every RFC 4791 filter and time-range rule, expand, limit-recurrence-set, free-busy-query) on the WebDAV core, read-only for iOS, macOS, Thunderbird, DAVx5 and Evolution. No ASP.NET Core, no EF Core, no reflection.",
